join bananazon_interviewer center
bananazon_interviewer: Welcome to the interview! This is a simple test.

bananazon_interviewer: Ready to start?

[signal arg="timer_start"]

- Yes, let's begin
	bananazon_interviewer: Excellent!
	[signal arg="correct_choice"]
	
- Not yet
	bananazon_interviewer: That's okay, take your time.
	[signal arg="wrong_choice"]

[signal arg="timer_end"]
bananazon_interviewer: Interview complete!
leave bananazon_interviewer
